12
00:00:39,670 --> 00:00:41,670
The army of the Daimae Dynasty

13
00:00:41,670 --> 00:00:44,440
Don't be discouraged, everyone

14
00:00:44,440 --> 00:00:46,440
Today's fight is just a small fight

15
00:00:47,440 --> 00:00:48,440
wait for some time

16
00:00:48,440 --> 00:00:50,440
